{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "20275",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.53,
      "end_seconds": 4.43,
      "duration_seconds": 3.9,
      "text": "Morning, doctor. Is this the right room?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.28,
      "end_seconds": 11.32,
      "duration_seconds": 5.04,
      "text": "Not at all, please sit. What seems to be wrong?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 11.95,
      "end_seconds": 16.4,
      "duration_seconds": 4.45,
      "text": "I wanted to get sore, gritty eyes looked at"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 18.03,
      "end_seconds": 21.25,
      "duration_seconds": 3.22,
      "text": "How many days or weeks has it been?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 22.45,
      "end_seconds": 24.68,
      "duration_seconds": 2.23,
      "text": "It's been two months now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 26.77,
      "end_seconds": 32.32,
      "duration_seconds": 5.55,
      "text": "Okay, give me more detail on it, whatever comes to mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 33.59,
      "end_seconds": 39.34,
      "duration_seconds": 5.75,
      "text": "only eye drops, and it's not much. Severe, I'd say"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 40.99,
      "end_seconds": 43.36,
      "duration_seconds": 2.37,
      "text": "Does anything else come with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 44.91,
      "end_seconds": 58.8,
      "duration_seconds": 13.89,
      "text": "Blurred vision after the screen goes along with it, most of the time the Blurred vision after the screen? That's been for nearly five years i've also had watery eyes"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 68.91,
      "end_seconds": 72.18,
      "duration_seconds": 3.27,
      "text": "Did you ever have any procedures done?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 72.99,
      "end_seconds": 77.78,
      "duration_seconds": 4.79,
      "text": "yeah, I had my septum straightened in my thirties"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 78.6,
      "end_seconds": 80.26,
      "duration_seconds": 1.66,
      "text": "who lives with you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 81.33,
      "end_seconds": 83.86,
      "duration_seconds": 2.53,
      "text": "My partner and our baby."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 85.72,
      "end_seconds": 87.0,
      "duration_seconds": 1.28,
      "text": "What's your work?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 93.16,
      "end_seconds": 97.5,
      "duration_seconds": 4.34,
      "text": "I'm a plumber, lots of bending and kneeling."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 99.59,
      "end_seconds": 103.75,
      "duration_seconds": 4.16,
      "text": "Any allergies to tablets, food or anything in the environment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 104.51,
      "end_seconds": 107.36,
      "duration_seconds": 2.85,
      "text": "Yes, cat fur. I get sneezing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 115.81,
      "end_seconds": 119.04,
      "duration_seconds": 3.23,
      "text": "Has anyone ever diagnosed you with something?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 120.95,
      "end_seconds": 122.5,
      "duration_seconds": 1.55,
      "text": "I have eczema."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 123.9,
      "end_seconds": 127.91,
      "duration_seconds": 4.01,
      "text": "Yes, carry on. Let's run through your medicines."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 129.98,
      "end_seconds": 133.01,
      "duration_seconds": 3.03,
      "text": "I'm on hydrocortisone cream, when needed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 133.55,
      "end_seconds": 135.2,
      "duration_seconds": 1.65,
      "text": "and for how long?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 136.86,
      "end_seconds": 138.34,
      "duration_seconds": 1.48,
      "text": "About six months."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 138.97,
      "end_seconds": 142.85,
      "duration_seconds": 3.88,
      "text": "Have you had flashing lights, by any chance?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 143.87,
      "end_seconds": 147.41,
      "duration_seconds": 3.54,
      "text": "Not that I've noticed, no flashing lights."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 149.34,
      "end_seconds": 155.2,
      "duration_seconds": 5.86,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any sensitivity to light, eye pain or discharge?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 155.97,
      "end_seconds": 159.49,
      "duration_seconds": 3.52,
      "text": "no, none that that I've noticed"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 161.15,
      "end_seconds": 164.58,
      "duration_seconds": 3.43,
      "text": "how are your joints, any aches elsewhere?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 166.08,
      "end_seconds": 167.55,
      "duration_seconds": 1.47,
      "text": "no, nothing there"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 170.11,
      "end_seconds": 173.99,
      "duration_seconds": 3.88,
      "text": "Let me get the readings out of the way."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 185.45,
      "end_seconds": 188.04,
      "duration_seconds": 2.59,
      "text": "That's it, just a little longer..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 198.47,
      "end_seconds": 207.74,
      "duration_seconds": 9.27,
      "text": "okay: pulse 84, temperature is 36.5 degrees, oxygen saturation is 98 percent. And BP is 121 over 71."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 208.3,
      "end_seconds": 209.83,
      "duration_seconds": 1.53,
      "text": "Is that okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 211.03,
      "end_seconds": 215.22,
      "duration_seconds": 4.19,
      "text": "They help me see the whole picture, more shortly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 217.68,
      "end_seconds": 221.99,
      "duration_seconds": 4.31,
      "text": "now I'm going to do a short physical check"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 227.12,
      "end_seconds": 228.86,
      "duration_seconds": 1.74,
      "text": "Yes, that's fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 230.03,
      "end_seconds": 233.05,
      "duration_seconds": 3.02,
      "text": "Right, I'll listen to your chest now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 242.06,
      "end_seconds": 248.74,
      "duration_seconds": 6.68,
      "text": "the eyes are slightly red with no discharge and the front of the eye looks clear"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 252.1,
      "end_seconds": 265.39,
      "duration_seconds": 13.29,
      "text": "Good, you can sit up again. Having listened and examined, I think we're dealing with dry eye syndrome at this stage. We shouldn't forget a need for new glasses."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 270.94,
      "end_seconds": 273.86,
      "duration_seconds": 2.92,
      "text": "is there something to worry about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 279.03,
      "end_seconds": 287.1,
      "duration_seconds": 8.07,
      "text": "nothing I've seen today points to an emergency it looks like dry eye syndrome, but I'd like to confirm"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 301.44,
      "end_seconds": 331.21,
      "duration_seconds": 29.77,
      "text": "I'd like to arrange an eye test for blurred vision. It's a routine test and it'll give us a much clearer picture. Let's use lubricant eye drops, 1 drop, four times a day, long term. That's for dry eyes. Take a screen break every twenty minutes and try to blink fully. Do get help quickly if you lose vision or get severe eye pain. I'll want another look in four weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 332.84,
      "end_seconds": 333.54,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 334.95,
      "end_seconds": 337.56,
      "duration_seconds": 2.61,
      "text": "Have I covered everything you wanted?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 338.96,
      "end_seconds": 343.48,
      "duration_seconds": 4.52,
      "text": "Mm, okay, that makes sense. Thanks for explaining."
    }
  ]
}